# VerbCoin example: the opening speech, the verb coin on the duck, the
# tunnel into the room with a z-buffer, and the inventory. Positions are in
# game pixels (640x480).
#
# Point at the duck (hit testing of the sprite) and open the verb coin,
# which freezes the scene and mixes the coin into it.
700 move 205 335
720 click 205 335
# Choose "look at".
760 move 200 318
800 click 200 318
# Walk through the tunnel, behind the walls of the z-buffer.
1200 click 75 320
# Open the inventory.
1900 move 90 435
1920 click 90 435
2000 capture
2100 quit
